    {
      "id": "claim_67e213c6b89f4660b089279c136f63ac",
      "statement": "The Electron-era release-signing scheme (Ed25519 signatures over the electron-updater feed via scripts/sign-release.cjs and the baked-in public key in src/model/updateSignature.ts) is obsolete: the 2.x Tauri release pipeline instead signs updater artifacts at build time via `createUpdaterArtifacts: true` and TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY, verified against the pubkey baked into src-tauri/tauri.conf.json with `requireSignedVersion: true`.",
