    {
      "id": "claim_3408f67be299400a9993cf1463a2257b",
      "statement": "Tauri config variants: `tauri.release.conf.json` overlays release builds to restrict `bundle.targets` to `app, dmg, nsis, appimage, deb, rpm` and set `createUpdaterArtifacts: true` (producing the signed `latest.json` feed), while `tauri.probe.conf.json` swaps the frontend to `vite.probe.config.ts` (root `e2e/`, output `dist-probe`, port 5199) so the probe binary embeds the e2e page; the cargo `probe` feature carries the CI probe commands and is never in a release build, and the release profile is size-optimized (`opt-level \"s\"`, lto, strip, codegen-units 1, panic abort).",
