    {
      "id": "claim_d0c31e57e59341029ce2406eb604b3b5",
      "statement": "The CI `tauri-build` job is a `fail-fast: false` matrix over macos-15, macos-26, windows-latest, ubuntu-22.04, ubuntu-24.04 that runs `cargo test`, builds the installer bundle (`npx tauri build`), then builds the probe (`--no-bundle --features probe --config src-tauri/tauri.probe.conf.json`) and runs it against `samples/project.example.json`, asserting the report contains both `RENDER OK` and `-> 403` (the traversal check), under `xvfb-run -a` on Ubuntu.",
