      "id": "claim_8cbd72be48b844a5affd987280d27ad8",
      "statement": "The CI `tauri-e2e` job runs `node --test e2e/probe.test.mjs` against the probe build via tauri-driver on ubuntu-24.04 and windows-latest only (no macOS support in tauri-driver); Windows installs a msedgedriver matching the installed WebView2 version from the EdgeUpdate registry key and runs the test through gsudo at medium integrity (`sudo --integrity Medium`, with icacls granting Everyone access to the workspace) because WebView2 ignores WEBVIEW2_ADDITIONAL_BROWSER_ARGUMENTS in the elevated runner.",
