    {
      "id": "claim_b99f51efff224c31b5f32def245d9b49",
      "statement": "The release `build` matrix runs tauri-action@v1 for four targets (macos-15 aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-apple-darwin, windows-latest x86_64-pc-windows-msvc, ubuntu-22.04 x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu) with `--config src-tauri/tauri.release.conf.json`, signing updater artifacts with TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY and attaching them to the draft release via the releaseId; macOS Apple secrets default to ad-hoc signing (`APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY` `-`, empty secrets deliberately not exported) and Windows Authenticode signing is optional, writing a tauri.windows.conf.json overlay only when WINDOWS_CERTIFICATE is set.",
