      "statement": "`release.yml` has a `check-updater-json` job that asserts the merged `latest.json` on the draft release lists all four platforms (darwin-aarch64, darwin-x86_64, windows-x86_64, linux-x86_64), because concurrent build jobs each merge their platform into the feed and a race can drop one.",
