      "statement": "On a published release, `release.yml`'s `zenodo` job archives the release on Zenodo as a new version of the existing concept record (recid 23804729, shared concept DOI): a `git archive` source zip plus all release assets, with the GitHub release notes (rendered to markdown) as description, GPL-3.0-only license, and an isIdentifiedTo related identifier; a new version starts from the previous version's files and publishing on Zenodo is permanent.",
