    {
      "id": "claim_3c0f2aa76b89467891a5ba20811b5208",
      "statement": "Besides the weekly `openwiki.yml` cron (which delegates to the shared ardoco/actions reusable workflow with OPENROUTER_API_KEY), `openwiki-update.yml` runs a daily 08:00 UTC self-contained update: it installs the openwiki npm CLI, runs `openwiki code --update --print` (OpenRouter provider, model z-ai/glm-5.2, LangSmith tracing), and opens a `docs: update OpenWiki` pull request scoped to `openwiki`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and the workflow file.",
